{"id": "12-410-2-2", "zh": "中性词", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-411-2-9", "zh": "130. citta（心），加 si。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-412-2-5", "zh": "“在中性词之后”与“在 a 之后、必定”承前而来。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-413-2-3", "zh": "（规则）si 变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-414-2-8", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的中性词之后，si 必定变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-414-9-10", "zh": "cittaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-415-2-5", "zh": "（规则）yo 变为 ni，“在中性词之后”承前而来。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-416-2-4", "zh": "（规则）在 a 之后，必定。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-417-2-12", "zh": "在以 a 结尾的中性词之后，yo 必定变为 ni，ni 又变为 ā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-417-13-14", "zh": "cittā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-417-15-21", "zh": "在另一种情形下，依“yosu”等规则延长元音，成为 cittāni。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-418-2-10", "zh": "131. ga 脱落时：he citta（心啊）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-418-11-14", "zh": "cittā，cittāni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-419-2-7", "zh": "132. cittaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-419-8-14", "zh": "ni 变为 e：citte，cittāni。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-419-15-17", "zh": "其余变化与 buddha 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-420-2-10", "zh": "133. mana（意），加 si，成为 manaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-421-2-4", "zh": "“nā”与“vā”承前而来。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "12-422-2-7", "zh": "134. 在 mana 组等词之后，smiṃ 与 nā 变为 i 与 ā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-423-2-7", "zh": "在 mana 等词之后，smiṃ 与 nā 可以变为 i 与 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-424-2-5", "zh": "（规则）遇元音时，可以插入增音 s。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-425-2-9", "zh": "当后面是格尾替代后的元音时，在 mana 等词之后可以插入增音 s。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-425-10-11", "zh": "manasā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-426-2-6", "zh": "135. sa 也变为 o。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-427-2-11", "zh": "在 mana 等词之后，sa 变为 o；由于有 ca（也）字，smā 也变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-427-12-15", "zh": "manaso，manasā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-428-2-7", "zh": "136. manasi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-428-8-10", "zh": "其余变化与 citta 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-429-2-4", "zh": "137.", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-430-2-11", "zh": "mana、sira、ura、teja，raja、oja、vaya、paya；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-431-2-9", "zh": "yasa、tapa、vaca、ceta，诸如此类，就是 mana 组。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-432-2-9", "zh": "138. guṇavantu（有德的），加 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-433-2-13", "zh": "依“Aṃ napuṃsake”（中性时变为 aṃ）这条规则，在 si 之前，ntu 连同格尾一起变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-433-14-15", "zh": "guṇavaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-433-16-20", "zh": "依 ntu 变为 nta 的规则：guṇavantāni。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "12-434-2-7", "zh": "139. 除 yo 以外，其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-434-8-10", "zh": "gacchaṃ 也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-435-2-6", "zh": "140. aṭṭhi（骨）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-436-2-3", "zh": "“vā”承前而来。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "12-437-2-12", "zh": "依“Yonaṃ ni napuṃsakehi”这条规则，yo 可以变为 ni。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-437-13-14", "zh": "aṭṭhīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-437-15-19", "zh": "因为属于 jha，yo 脱落时：aṭṭhī。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-437-20-21", "zh": "呼格也是这样。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-438-2-10", "zh": "141. aṭṭhiṃ，aṭṭhīni，aṭṭhī。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "12-438-11-13", "zh": "其余变化与 aggi 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-439-2-8", "zh": "142. daṇḍī（持杖者），加 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-440-2-6", "zh": "因为不属于 gha，元音变短：daṇḍi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "12-440-7-9", "zh": "除 yo 以外，其余与阳性相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-441-2-7", "zh": "143. āyu（寿命）的变化与 aṭṭhi 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-442-2-3", "zh": "中性词完。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-443-2-2", "zh": "阳性兼阴性词", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-444-2-23", "zh": "144. 阳性兼阴性词：ghaṭa、kaṭa、yaṭṭhi、muṭṭhi、sindhu、reṇu 等，以及表示两足类、四足类的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-445-2-7", "zh": "例如：ghaṭo；加 ī 词缀，成为 ghaṭī。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-445-8-13", "zh": "eso yaṭṭhi（阳性），esā yaṭṭhi（阴性）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-446-2-6", "zh": "表示两足类的词，例如：khattiyo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-446-7-13", "zh": "加 ā 词缀，成为 khattiyā；samaṇo，加 ī，成为 samaṇī 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-447-2-14", "zh": "表示四足类的词，例如：gajo，加 ā，成为 gajā；byaggho，加 ī，成为 byagghī 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-448-2-2", "zh": "阳性兼中性词", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-449-2-63", "zh": "145. 阳性兼中性词：dhamma、kamma、brahma、kusuma、saṅgama、paduma、assama、vihāra、sarīra、suvaṇṇa、vaṇṇa、kahāpaṇa、bhavana、bhuvana、yobbana、bhusana、āsana、sayana、odana、ākāsa、upavāsa、māsa、divasa、rasa、thala、phala、raṭṭha、ambu、madhu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-450-2-2", "zh": "阴性兼中性词", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "12-451-2-10", "zh": "146. 阴性兼中性词：以 nagara、acci 为首的词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-452-2-2", "zh": "三性通用词", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-453-2-19", "zh": "147. 三性通用词：taṭa、puṭa、patta、maṇḍala、kalasa 等，用作人名的词，以及一切代词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "12-453-20-29", "zh": "例如：taṭo，加 ī，成为 taṭī，以及 taṭaṃ 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "12-454-2-11", "zh": "用作人名的词，例如：devadatto，加 ā，成为 devadattā，以及 devadattaṃ 等。", "confidence": 75}
